# Spectra NGO — Core ERP

Multi-tenant dog-shelter NGO ERP. Shared PostgreSQL + `tenant_id`. Never leak across tenants/branches.

## Stack

- Backend: Java 21, Spring Boot 3, JPA/Hibernate, JWT (stateless), Flyway
- Frontend: Next.js App Router + TS, Tailwind, Lucide, shadcn-style, TanStack Query
- API: `/api` · envelope `{ success, data, message, errorCode }`
- Demo password (seed): `Spectra@123`

## Org hierarchy (revised)

`Tenant (NGO)` → `Branch` → Users (+ `user_branches`)

**Unified inventory (canonical):** each branch has **one physical stockroom**. Dog food, vaccines/meds, and staff retail goods share the same inward GRN, batches, and FEFO engine. Do **not** design new features around separate shelter vs retail warehouses.

Legacy code may still have `SHELTER_STORE` / `STAFF_RETAIL_STORE` + split product tables — treat as tech debt to converge on one warehouse + one product catalog (flags/categories for retail vs clinical).

Working context = branch (`X-Branch-Id` + JWT). `PLATFORM_ADMIN` provisions NGOs only.

## Roles

| Role | Scope |
|------|--------|
| `PLATFORM_ADMIN` | Create/enable NGOs |
| `NGO_ADMIN` | Spec SUPER_ADMIN: branches, users, cross-branch, company payroll |
| `BRANCH_ADMIN` | Leave, audit write-off, vendor settle, branch payroll |
| `INVENTORY_MANAGER` | Unified GRN, audits, consumption, Staff POS, expiry |
| `VET_TECH_EMPLOYEE` | Dogs, notes, vaccines, feeding |
| `EMPLOYEE` | Leave / LOP, credit buy, passbook, payslip |

Never reintroduce `SUPER_ADMIN` enum — map to `NGO_ADMIN`.

## Non-negotiables

- Mobile-first touch UI
- Schema only via Flyway
- `TenantContext` + `@TenantId` on every write path
- Extend modules; no parallel microservice split
